除稅額。","If the item is for self use, select Keep (=untax) and/or enter Custom price:":"自用物品請勾選「保留」（不扣稅），或輸入自訂價格：","Market":"市場","Custom":"自訂","Keep":"保留","Effective":"有效價格","Region:":"地區：","Usage:":"用途：","craftables,":"可製作物品，","stackable":"可堆疊","CP (with chain)":"貢獻度（含房屋連接）","usage/level":"用途/等級","any":"全部","import":"匯入","export":"匯出","Empire":"帝國","All towns/workers list":"所有城鎮與工人","fetching":"正在取得資料","all prices fetched":"所有價格已取得","not fetched from either provider: {count}":"兩個來源均未取得價格：{count}","no prices fetched":"未取得價格","contains:":"內含：","Unable to load page data. Check your connection and try again.":"無法載入頁面資料，請檢查連線後重試。","Unable to load the route planner. Please try again.":"無法載入路徑規劃器，請重試。","not assigned":"未分配","town used:":"目前城鎮：","suggested:":"建議：","% better)":"% 更好）","worker used:":"目前工人：","all good":"配置合適","expected updates":"預期刷新次數","size ≥":"尺寸 ≥","brought by:":"來源：","from":"來自","no storage":"無倉庫","mass production":"大量生產","unable to resolve housing at {town}":"無法配置 {town} 的住房","Housing costs shared equally among active jobs from this town:":"此城鎮的住房與倉庫成本由所有啟用任務平均分攤：","Housing costs shared in proportion to active job income from this town:":"此城鎮的住房與倉庫成本依各任務收益比例分攤：","All housing costs for {town}":"{town} 的全部住房與倉庫成本","not supported":"不支援","divided by":"除以","crates":"箱","% utilization":"% 使用率","workers +":"名工人＋","minute tier":"分鐘區間","chance %":"機率 %","Resource threshold chance: {chance}%":"資源門檻機率：{chance}%","or more resource %, or":"以上資源 %，或","or less workload, or":"以下工作量，或","min cycle":"分鐘週期","by BS/FVS (":"依基礎/變動尺寸（","by AVG (":"依平均尺寸（","ALL":"全部","Profits here are calculated using average level 40 stats for artisan workers at corresponding town (papu/dokkebi/etc), with only one skill (+5🔨). Home page has more tiers, levels, and skills.":"此處收益採用相應城鎮的 40 級匠人工人平均屬性（帕普、鬼怪等），只計一項 +5🔨 技能。首頁支援更多品級、等級與技能。","Note that CP costs shown here are independent for each node. In practice however, multiple resource nodes can reuse the same town connection, resulting in higher combined $/CP.":"此處貢獻度成本為各節點獨立計算。實際上多個採集點可共用城鎮連接，提高合計每貢獻度收益。","For example, taking both Shakatu Fig nodes should not be 3+3 but 3+1 CP. Use Home page instead of Plantzones to take into account connection reuse (and also lodging/storage costs).":"例如沙卡魯兩個無花果節點合計應為 3+1，而非 3+3 貢獻度。要計入共用連接、宿舍與倉庫成本，請使用首頁。","Don't forget to set up your server and prices on Settings page and maybe take a look at Resources as well. 👺=goblin, 👨=human, 🐢=giant, hover for more info":"請在設定頁選擇伺服器與價格，並確認資源設定。👺＝哥布林，👨＝人類，🐢＝巨人；滑鼠懸停可查看詳情。","assigned on Home page? (hover for details) 'X% better' does not consider: - worker stats - worker skills - connection reuse - lodging and storage":"是否已在首頁分配？（懸停查看詳情）「提升 X%」未計入工人屬性、技能、共用連接、宿舍及倉庫。","These values are shown ingame as green bars at world map > resource view.":"遊戲中世界地圖的資源檢視以綠色條顯示這些數值。","However, the client has several resource bars hidden/misplaced, for those you can check the current workload in worker assignment panel ingame and infer the resource% from that.":"部分資源條隱藏或位置不正確，可查看遊戲工人派遣面板中的工作量，反推資源百分比。","Low (exhausted) resource means workloads of relevant nodes are increased (up to 2x of base) so each job takes longer to complete.":"資源不足時，相關節點工作量增加（最高為基礎值的兩倍），每次工作耗時更長。","If unspecified here, 0% resource will be used (= max workload = longest cycle = min cycles per day = min profit)":"未設定時使用 0% 資源，即最高工作量、最長週期、最低每日次數與收益。","use Sho's Workshop Profitability Calculator & gpw Trading/Crates Calculator to find out. For crates, enter profit per 1 crate - if a worker with +1/+3 packing skill occupies this workshop it will be taken into account.":"可用 Sho 的工作坊收益計算器及 gpw 的貿易裝箱計算器估算。箱子請輸入每箱收益；工人的 +1/+3 裝箱技能會自動計入。","Full cost of operating the workshop, including: 1) the workshop itself; 2) house chain to connect the workshop (*after* autoassigned houses shown in Home > town config > Found cost spoiler); 3) storage for input/output mats, if not provided by (2). The only thing to not include here is lodging for the worker who is going to occupy the workshop. However, if your workshop house chain does provide lodging, reduce (2) accordingly. The house chain can potentially provide storage and lodging not only for this workshop, but for other workshops of this town. In this case, use average CP value (sum up all workshop-related CP costs and divide by active workshop count).":"輸入工作坊完整運作成本：1）工作坊本身；2）首頁自動配置房屋以外的房屋連接；3）上述連接未提供的材料倉庫。不要計入該工人的宿舍；若房屋連接提供宿舍，應扣除對應成本。若同一房屋鏈供多個工作坊共用，輸入平均貢獻度（工作坊總成本除以啟用工作坊數）。","Optimization settings changed. This result uses the previous settings; optimize again before applying.":"優化設定已變更，此結果仍使用先前設定，請重新優化後套用。","Enter a price such as 1500, 1.5k or 2m.":"請輸入價格，例如 1500、1.5k 或 2m。","Added nodes":"新增節點","Removed nodes":"移除節點","Close":"關閉","Cancel":"取消","Undo":"復原","Dialog":"對話視窗","Confirm change":"確認變更","Changes saved. You can undo this action.":"變更已儲存，可復原此次操作。","Action undone.":"已復原操作。","Undo is unavailable because these settings changed.":"設定已再次變更，無法復原。","You can undo this action until these settings change again.":"這些設定再次變更前，可復原此次操作。","Remove all {count} workers?":"移除全部 {count} 名工人？","Clear {count} custom price and keep settings?":"清除 {count} 項自訂價格與自用設定？","Clear resource settings for {count} groups?":"清除 {count} 個資源群組的設定？","Remove {count} unused workshops?":"移除 {count} 間未使用的工坊？","Invalid configuration file.":"設定檔格式無效。","The file is not valid JSON.":"檔案不是有效的 JSON。","This file does not contain the expected configuration.":"檔案不含此處需要的設定。","Invalid worker data in configuration file.":"設定檔中的工人資料無效。","Configuration files must be smaller than 10 MB.":"設定檔必須小於 10 MB。","Reading configuration…":"讀取設定中…","Import preview":"匯入預覽","Confirm import":"確認匯入","Only the listed sections will be replaced. Other settings are kept.":"僅覆寫以下列出的設定，其餘設定保留。","Current workers: {count}":"目前工人：{count}","Workers":"工人","Storage":"倉庫","Custom prices":"自訂價格","Search nodes, items or towns":"搜尋節點、物品或城鎮","No results found.":"沒有符合的結果。","Plan your worker empire":"規劃你的工人帝國","Choose your server and tax, then import workers or start an optimization.":"先選擇伺